{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつも読んでくださってる方、\n初めて読んでくださった方、\nコメントしてくださった方、\nありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かずみと^^\n怪談、最初怖かったけど、\nおもしろかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そういえばBloGで伝え忘れてた！\nテスト終わりましたっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日返却されたああぁぁあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先生やクラスのみんなが\n協力してくれたおかげで\n良い点数をとることができました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日ね、学校帰りに電車乗ってて、\n眠くなって寝てしまったの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"で、起きたら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここはどこや。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっか、遠くまで\n行ってしまいましたね"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0003.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"てへ、ぺろ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まぁここまでよう寝ましたなぁー！\nてくらい遠くまで行ってた。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"新記録だ。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この前も寝過ごしたけど、\n今日はすごかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0004.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんも寝過ごしちゃうこと\nありませんか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"自分の降りたい駅までに\n起きる方法教えてください"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに中学のイツメンに遭遇‼"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いっぱいしゃべったー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0007.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか全然変わってないね\nて言われてうれしかったっっ><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただ、幼くなったね\nとも言われた"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"...\nその後、通ってたバレエ教室に\nおじゃましてきました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここでも"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"変わってないね"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だって‼\nうれしいよ！なんかうれしいよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレエ踊りたくなってきた♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日すごい楽しかった。やっふい\n久しぶりに友達に会えたし！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0010.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんにもまた大阪で会える"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全握"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0013.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"楽しみですっっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では明日も頑張りまりか"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"びよん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/photos/entry/2012/07/10/2411877/0015.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}